      "comment": "MY BREAD ROLL (1) is a well performed dog and winner of 12 races who is worth forgiving after finishing out of the placings at this track (23.58). Has a good record here at this journey. Tough to beat if on-song. JET FUEL (2) turned in a modest effort most recently when fifth at Maitland over 400m behind Despicable Kyro (22.97) in a Grade 4/5. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Deserves plenty of respect. MAEVE BABY (3) has missed the frame at her last two but did run well three back when second (23.49) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Has the ability and can find best this time. SEMI PEAKIN' (7) generally performs well from this box.",
